{"id":"bd-n9j","title":"Add OAuth scopes for library mutation","description":"Add user-library-modify, user-follow-modify, playlist-modify-private, and playlist-modify-public to the OAuth scope set. Required before phase-2 commands can call PUT/DELETE on /me/tracks, /me/following, or playlist endpoints. Triggers another 'spot auth' re-consent.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-05-05T18:54:42.324118Z","created_by":"jeff","updated_at":"2026-05-05T19:08:06.091333Z","closed_at":"2026-05-05T19:08:06.091217Z","close_reason":"merged via f747d62 (combined to avoid play.go conflict)","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["infra","oauth","phase-2"]}
