{"id":"bd-xho","title":"SQLite scaffold for local event/memory store","description":"Add modernc.org/sqlite (pure-Go) dep. Open/migrate spot.db at the dir of SPOTIFY_TOKEN_PATH (default cwd), mode 0600. Implement a single 'events' table (id, kind, track_id, artist_id, zone, source, payload JSON, occurred_at) plus indexes on (track_id, occurred_at) and (kind, occurred_at). Provide an internal helper to insert events. No data wiring yet — that lands in T17/T18.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-05-05T18:54:42.346809Z","created_by":"jeff","updated_at":"2026-05-05T19:08:06.162563Z","closed_at":"2026-05-05T19:08:06.162529Z","close_reason":"merged via c647155","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["infra","phase-3","sqlite"]}
